{"articleNo":"87992","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=87992&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 2학기 생활관 추가합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.08.06","hit":"5071","attachments":[{"name":"2013-2 추가합격자 현황.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=87992&attachNo=72477"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013학년도 2학기 생활관 추가합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 합격자 명단 : 첨부파일을 열어 탭으로 관 선택</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 납부기간</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 2013. 8. 7(수)~9(금) 10:00~16:00</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 납부은행</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 고지서 출력</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2013. 8. 7(수) 09:00부터 8. 9(금) 16:00까지 고지서 출력 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 농협 방문 납부</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 방문 납부 아닐시 17시까지 이체 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #666666\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>입금 기한 마지막날(금요일) 입금자는 다음주 월요일에 확인 가능하므로 마지막날을 피해 납부 바람</strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #666666\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #f40000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> <strong>납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">7. 추가합격&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\">2013.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\">8. 9(금)이후 미등록자 및 환불자에 대한 결원은 생활관 행정실에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000\">불합격자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\">중 차순위자에게</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;순서대로 개별 연락하여 선발함</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8. 문의</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 푸름관 (478-7203, 7270), 오름관 (478-7942) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013. 8. 6</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관장</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
